  { t: "journal", q: "What do you do to protect the environment? Write three sentences.", vi: "Viết 3 câu về những việc bạn làm để bảo vệ môi trường.", kw: ["recycle/reuse/reduce", "plastic", "bag/bottle/bottles"], m: "I always take my own bag when I go shopping. I try not to use plastic straws. At home, my family recycles paper and plastic bottles." }
