  { t: "journal", q: "What will you do if you have free time this weekend? Write three sentences.", vi: "Viết 3 câu: nếu cuối tuần này rảnh, bạn sẽ làm gì?", kw: ["if", "will/'ll", "unless/in case/as long as"], m: "If I have free time this weekend, I'll visit my best friend. If the weather is nice, we'll go for a walk in the park. I'll take an umbrella in case it rains." }
