  { t: "porder", p: ["When I was ten, I got lost at a big market.", "I was looking at some toys, and when I looked up, my mom was gone.", "I was very scared, but I didn't cry.", "As soon as I saw a police officer, I asked him for help.", "After ten minutes, my mom found me and hugged me tightly."] },
  { t: "journal", q: "Write three sentences about a funny or scary thing that happened to you.", vi: "Viết 3 câu kể về một chuyện vui hoặc đáng sợ đã xảy ra với bạn.", kw: ["when", "because/so/but", "was/were"], m: "Last year, I was walking home when it suddenly started to rain. I didn't have an umbrella, so I ran into a small café. The owner was very kind, and she gave me a free cup of hot tea." }
