  { t: "match", lab: "Ghép hai nửa câu", pr: ["I remember locking the door,|so I'm sure the house is safe.", "Remember to lock the door|when you leave.", "I stopped smoking|five years ago.", "I stopped to buy some water|because I was thirsty.", "Try restarting your phone;|that might fix the problem."] }
